**/config/wifi_paired_devices.json
**/config/build_info.json

# ===== 发布产物 / Release artifacts =====
# 安装包不入库，由 .github/workflows/release.yml 打 tag 后发到 GitHub Releases。
# Installers are published to GitHub Releases, never committed.
Super_ADB_mac.zip
Super_ADB_win64.zip
Super_ADB_linux_*.tar.gz
*.dmg
安装包/

